"Quinyeth-wit, called Quinyeth, is a young votary student at Rapport School, younger than Stuart."
"She is short, with white hair sprouting from a clip, and knows a few words of many Earth languages."
"She wants to be Asay-tor's votary and secretly trains to be a casting assistant on his missions."
"She has no knights in her family and is secretly wistful about knighthood."
"She broke a chaos painting's hold on Alden by covering his eyes; he promised her honey."
"She had a devotion chip implanted in her cheek to show Asay-tor."
"Asay said no to her joining his first mission and told her to wait a year."
